    "text": "CONCLUDED\nLast Updated:\n22 hours ago\nApple Stock Turns Negative After AI Updates\nApple stock slipped into negative territory on Monday as Wall Street seemed underwhelmed by the company's artificial intelligence updates.\nShares were down 1% to $304.42 about an hour into the WWDC keynote. The stock's decline started as Apple shared highly anticipated AI upgrades to Siri.\nThe stock had been as much as 3.3% higher on Monday.",
